<title>USA: Chemtrak to sell $7.0 mln in convertibles.</title>
<headline>Chemtrak to sell $7.0 mln in convertibles.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>ChemTrak Inc said Monday that it plans to sell up to $7.0 million of convertible stock in a private placement.</p>
<p>The convertible securities are expected to have a fixed dividend and will be convertible into common stock on a formula based on a percentage of the trailing average closing prices of ChemTrak common stock on the Nasdaq National Market.</p>
<p>ChemTrak said it will use the net proceeds for general corporate purposes, advertising and promotion as well as research and development.</p>
